# #5837, the staleHigh obligation carried from #5841 (a5e2e2ef, #5837 comment 6658448943, H2):
# the donor's staleHigh counts its records from every non-closing token, epoch-only
# writes included.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestStaleHighOmitsEpochOnlyNonClosingToken
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the WAL leaves a stale duplicate's epoch-only write out of the donor's staleHigh, so the receiver's deferred bound and guard miss it and it advances past the record unapplied
PERTURBS: StaleEpochOnlyAlloc
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithEpochOnly = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithDonorRestart = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {next}
    /\ sHi' = Max2(sHi, next)
--- REPLACE
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {next}
\* MUTATION: an epoch-only record is not counted in staleHigh.
    /\ UNCHANGED sHi
--- END
